RQ6 external-boundary execution record
======================================

Pinned public sources:
  nvidia/Open-SWE-Traces @ 9c0e4579a4ee0effa3e5f7a552494a045f29377d
  AliceKJ/IdeaTrail @ 56a26582c8723992ce1e9e289953e24e03977aa7

Plan and amendments:
  The plan passed an independent read-only plan review. The formal sample was
  amended to the first 64 SHA-256-ranked units per stratum after acquisition
  started but before relation metrics were computed or inspected. This is a
  pre-analysis amendment, not a pre-outcome amendment. The deterministic
  256-candidate prefix per stratum remains in full/selection-plan.csv.
  Acquisition transport was changed from row-level HEAD checks to HEAD checks
  before and after batches of at most 32 rows after rate limiting; row IDs,
  offsets, revision, and SHA-256 checks are unchanged.

Local path-compatible anchor:
  python3 agentvis/research/freeze_rq6_local_anchor.py \
    --input docs/tmp/build-and-evaluate/step-0002-20260722T003659-0700/experiment-rq4-20260722T013003-0700/raw/rq4-accesses.csv \
    --output docs/tmp/bootstrap/step-0002-20260722T182000-0700/experiment-rq6-external-boundary/local-anchor.csv \
    --metadata docs/tmp/bootstrap/step-0002-20260722T182000-0700/experiment-rq6-external-boundary/local-anchor.json
  result: 6 projects, 78,102 path-resolved Tool calls, 78,090 transitions.

Preflight:
  python3 agentvis/research/rq6_external_boundary.py \
    --workers 8 --request-interval 0.2 --preflight \
    --output docs/tmp/bootstrap/step-0002-20260722T182000-0700/experiment-rq6-external-boundary/preflight
  result: 8 rows (one per Open-SWE stratum and four IdeaTrail topics); all
  relation directions remain N/A below the 50-unit gate.

Authoritative full run:
  python3 agentvis/research/rq6_external_boundary.py \
    --workers 16 --request-interval 0.2 \
    --output docs/tmp/bootstrap/step-0002-20260722T182000-0700/experiment-rq6-external-boundary/full
  result: 320 stratum-specific selections; 64 independent units per stratum.
  Open-SWE contributes 256 selections and 255 unique instance IDs across
  strata because pingcap__tidb-lightning-508 occurs in two harness/model strata.

Independent source checker:
  python3 agentvis/research/check_rq6_sources.py \
    --experiment docs/tmp/bootstrap/step-0002-20260722T182000-0700/experiment-rq6-external-boundary/full \
    --output docs/tmp/bootstrap/step-0002-20260722T182000-0700/experiment-rq6-external-boundary/full/source-check-independent.json
  result: PASS; 320/320 rows, 31,249 Tool calls, 22,433 path-resolved calls,
  22,113 transitions, and zero mismatches.

Estimator correction:
  E4 counts only path-resolved Tool calls strictly between module visits;
  A,B,A has return gap 1. The public and local path-compatible projections use
  the same definition. This correction changes return medians but not path
  transition counts, observed-return counts, coverage gates, or direction.
  All generated CSVs use explicit LF line endings for deterministic repository
  artifacts.

